{"title":"Wednesday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/973307498/0/marginalrevolution~Wednesday-assorted-links.html","date":1795020106000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2122694748666528168\" target=\"_blank\">Chinese AI companies way down in value</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/AllisonSchrager/status/2122794615367512484\" target=\"_blank\">Allison Schrager is starting a podcast with Ken Rogoff</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/papers/w36021#fromrss\" target=\"_blank\">Extensive survey of students on AI</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://quillette.com/2026/11/17/the-last-acceptable-prejudice-lookism/\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Lynch on lookism</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://claudeblattman.com/\" target=\"_blank\">New version of Claude Blattman</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/sebkrier/status/2123015473507733777\" target=\"_blank\">Seb Krier on the Christiano interview</a>.  The whole dialogue over this interview is a good example of why we have needed (and not really received) a peer-reviewed tier to the discourse on these aspects of AI safety.  A more rigorous argument really needed to be forced here.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/WarMonitor3/status/2123014627281785150\" target=\"_blank\">Poland foiled a Kaliningrad operation?</a></p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/wednesday-assorted-links-580.html\">Wednesday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.c